# gfxsmoke.fpr -- the FPR_DESKTOP_GL branch, exercised.
# glInit creates the GLFW window + GL 3.3 context + FBO; glSavePpm
# forces a framebuffer readback to disk.  Run under xvfb-run against a
# qosp built with QOSP_GFX + FPR_DESKTOP_GL (make -C qos portable-gl);
# the same binary drives a real desktop window on a Mac.  The EGL/ES
# host takes the identical path headless, so this is also the smallest
# gfx-capability check.
main =
  d = glInit 640 480;
  r = glSavePpm "/tmp/gfx-smoke.ppm";
  "gfx smoke: ppm rc={r}".
